Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:04.95,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}狙いさだめた  指先がさす
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:07.32,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}運命は絶望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.34,0:22:09.92,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}それとも希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:16.37,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}ゆらぎの中で  受信してゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.39,0:22:18.51,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}悲しみにも負けない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:21.20,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}勇気だけをください
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:27.45,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}大切なもの  守るため
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:32.86,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}「強さ」はあると信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:38.72,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future　一緒に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.99,0:22:41.88,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}明日へのドア開いた空へ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.89,0:22:44.34,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛び立とう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.49,0:22:50.20,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}とある世界の果てで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.31,0:22:55.96,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}駆け抜けてく　Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:23:03.58,edjp,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}光を放って!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.77,0:22:04.95,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}那命中注定的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.97,0:22:07.32,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}是絕望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.34,0:22:09.92,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}還是希望?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:16.37,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}在搖擺中 發送著信息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.39,0:22:18.51,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}請賜予我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.53,0:22:21.20,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}不會向悲傷低頭的勇氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:27.45,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}為了保護珍貴的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:32.86,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}我相信自己的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:38.72,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}Saving our future  讓我們一同
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.99,0:22:41.88,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}敞開明天的門  向開闊的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.89,0:22:44.34,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}展翅高飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.49,0:22:50.20,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}向那世界的彼端
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.31,0:22:55.96,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}飛馳而去 Real Force
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:23:03.58,edcn,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}散發出光芒!
